// every downstream writer (_rapierProjectStyledRoot for HTML/Share/print, _rapierProjectPortableRoot
// for DOCX/TXT) since both clone from the semanticRoot this runs against -- do not fork the
// writers, remove the facts once at the one root they all read. `data-md-layout`/`data-md-align`
