		// it and it is far smaller; ON converts to the PNG or JPEG an older reader needs. The share
		// sheet's toggle IS the state (one truth, no mirrored copy, nothing stored: whether THIS page
		// goes to an old reader is a fact about this share, not about the person). A caller may say.
		// R86d: a Word document cannot carry JPEG XL at all, so DOCX always converts (the picture
		// format law: "DOCX, PDF and the shared web page carry a codec every destination shows,
		// automatically"). With the toggle read here for DOCX too, a JPEG XL picture reached
