// data-rapier-remote-src, or the editor shows the blocked placeholder: the block is the reader's);
// a data picture keeps its own bytes (data-rapier-image-url) and a local picture the bytes of its
// reference into the picture appendix (`appendix` reads them), never the stand-in, portable copy or
// paper's inking the editor presents in its place; a reference whose bytes are gone keeps no stand-in.
